.TH "GENI\-UPLOADER\-WHOAMI" "1" "October 2026" "geni-uploader 1.0.0" "Geni Uploader Manual"
.SH NAME
geni\-uploader\-whoami \- verify Geni API credentials and print the authenticated profile
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B geni\-uploader whoami
.SH DESCRIPTION
Verifies the access token by fetching the authenticated profile and prints it. Use it to confirm credentials before planning an upload. Read\-only.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI "\-\-token\-file " "TOKEN_FILE"
file outside the repo holding the access token (global, before the command)
.TP
.B \-\-help
Show a short summary and the option list, then exit.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
